            "block_content": "(iii) Employees owning mobile homes located on real property not owned by the Employee as their principle place of residence may have the option of (a) having the Company ship it to the new Work Location at the Company's expense provided the value of the mobile home exceeds the estimated cost of shipment or (b) with advance Company approval, sell it privately and be reimbursed for approved selling expenses.",
